144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 90 0 R
/T (SignVision is a machine learning-based system designed to recognize hand gestures representing sign language alphabets and convert them into readable text. The system uses a labeled image dataset to train models that can identify different hand signs. It combines Machine Learning, Computer Vision, and Image Processing to perform gesture recognition. The project aims to explore how intelligent systems can help reduce communication barriers and support accessibility for people who use sign language.)
/E (SignVision is a machine learning-based system designed to recognize hand gestures representing sign language alphabets and convert them into readable text. The system uses a labeled image dataset to train models that can identify different hand signs. It combines Machine Learning, Computer Vision, and Image Processing to perform gesture recognition. The project aims to explore how intelligent systems can help reduce communication barriers and support accessibility for people who use sign language.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 91 0 R
