146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 91 0 R
/T (Communication between sign language users and people who do not understand sign language can be challenging, especially when an interpreter is unavailable. This may create difficulties in everyday situations such as education, public services, and social interactions. SignVision aims to address this problem by recognizing hand gestures and displaying their corresponding alphabets as text. The motivation behind this project is to develop a simple and accessible application that demonstrates how machine learning can support easier communication.)
/E (Communication between sign language users and people who do not understand sign language can be challenging, especially when an interpreter is unavailable. This may create difficulties in everyday situations such as education, public services, and social interactions. SignVision aims to address this problem by recognizing hand gestures and displaying their corresponding alphabets as text. The motivation behind this project is to develop a simple and accessible application that demonstrates how machine learning can support easier communication.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
