592 0 obj
<<
/Title (Several research studies have explored machine learning and deep learning techniques for sign language and hand gesture recognition. Traditional algorithms such as Logistic Regression and Random Forest can be applied to classification tasks using suitable image features. Convolutional Neural Networks \(CNNs\) are particularly useful for image classification because they can learn visual patterns directly from images. Research also highlights the importance of preprocessing, data augmentation, and proper model evaluation in developing reliable recognition systems. These approaches form the foundation of the SignVision project.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 585 0 R
>>
endobj
