598 0 obj
<<
/Title (Although different techniques are available for sign language recognition, their performance can vary depending on the dataset, lighting conditions, image quality, and hand position. Some approaches focus on a single classification model, making it difficult to understand how alternative methods perform under similar conditions. There is a need to compare multiple models using the same dataset and consistent evaluation metrics. SignVision addresses this aspect by comparing Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and CNN models and exploring their use in image-based and webcam-based sign recognition.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 593 0 R
/Next 601 0 R
>>
endobj
